# Wave H.p — Operator datetime / date-picker BEM

## Problem

Wave H.l.b neutralized **component names** and **data attrs** for time chrome (`operator-time-picker*`, `data-operator-wizard-time-*`), but CSS/JSX still emitted Denali-branded **BEM** for the sibling date/datetime shells:

| Token family | Status before H.p |
| ------------ | ----------------- |
| `.operator-time-picker*` | already operator |
| `.denali-wizard-datetime*` | still Denali-branded |
| `.denali-date-picker*` | still Denali-branded |

Separately, `isDenaliOperatorSession` was a deprecated no-op alias of `isExtendedOperatorSession` with **zero production call sites** — leftover false product coupling in the admin session helper.

## Decision

1. Rename BEM (TSX + CSS + e2e/scripts + theme specs) in lockstep:

| Before | After |
| ------ | ----- |
| `denali-wizard-datetime` (+ elements) | `operator-wizard-datetime` |
| `denali-date-picker` (+ elements/modifiers) | `operator-date-picker` |

2. Keep selectors under `body[data-workspace-plugin="denali"]` — skin scoping stays plugin-keyed; only the **class brand** becomes operator-neutral (same pattern as H.l.b time BEM).

3. **Delete** `isDenaliOperatorSession` from `require-operator-session.ts` (callers already use `isExtendedOperatorSession`; `tours-edit.spec` already forbids the Denali name on the edit client).

## Out of scope

- Broader wizard BEM (`.denali-wizard-composite`, pickers, …); review BEM → [`wave-h-operator-review-bem.mdoc`](./wave-h-operator-review-bem.mdoc) (Wave H.r)
- ~~`denali-wizard-calendar*` BEM~~ → **done in** [`wave-h-operator-wizard-calendar-bem.mdoc`](./wave-h-operator-wizard-calendar-bem.mdoc) (Wave H.q)
- Package export renames (`buildDenaliCreatePrefilledFormCore`, …)
- Install-graph isolation / IgnorePlugin removal

## Verify

```bash
rg 'denali-wizard-datetime|denali-date-picker|isDenaliOperatorSession' \
  apps/web packages/workspaces/denali --glob '!**/*.generated.*'
# expect empty (except this ADR / verify lists)
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/wave-h-operator-datetime-bem.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-operator-datetime-chrome.spec.ts \
  test/denali-wizard-theme.spec.ts \
  test/tours-edit.spec.ts
```
